The scripts under doc/fork/ (the Python, shell, Tcl, PowerShell and BASIC
files) and the tone sequences they read (doc/fork/y8960/level/*.txt) are
licensed under the MIT License below, except:

- doc/fork/y8960/level/rhythm-ws/rhymodel.py, which contains code derived
  from openMSX (GPL-2.0-only) and Nuked-OPL3 (LGPL-2.1). The scripts that
  import it are covered, but need it to run.
- doc/fork/y8960/level/mse_fm_filter.py, which contains values taken from a
  schematic.

These two files stay under the license of this repository. The documents
(the .md files and doc/fork/upstream-touched.txt) are not covered.

